      "ROBERTA: Watch it, you idiots! Be careful with those!\nASSUNTA: Why so many?",
      "JANET: If you could teach our students to play like that, I'd be thrilled, but --\nROBERTA: I can. Any child can learn the violin.",
      "ROBERTA: I'll teach them to have discipline.\nJANET: A lot of our parents are struggling to feed their kids and pay the rent -- they don't have time to help them learn violin.\nROBERTA: They don't have to. If they can help, great -- but these kids will be committed. They'll practice on their own, they'll help each other in t…",
      "ROBERTA: You will.\nJANET: For now I'll put you down as a sub, but I have to warn you -- even if it works out, the Board may not let me create a permanent position for…\nROBERTA: That's O.K. I'll worry about that later. Thank you.",
      "ROBERTA: Anyone remember what this is?\nROBERTA: Lucy! Do you like people snapping their fingers when you're talking?\nLUCY: Yeah!\nROBERTA: What is this called?"
    ]
